1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,100
May solar ka, pero may
Meralco bill ka pa rin?

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:06,220
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:06,570 --> 00:00:08,560
Sa typical
self-consumption setup,

4
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:11,950
tumutulong ang solar sa
daytime electricity use mo.

5
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:14,400
Pero kapag kulang
ang solar generation,

6
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:16,370
o gabi na at wala
kang battery,

7
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:18,680
puwede ka pa ring kumuha
ng kuryente sa grid.

8
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:21,870
May mga bill charges din
na hindi basta nawawala.

9
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:25,050
Kaya hindi dapat mangako
ng automatic zero bill.

10
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:30,930
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

11
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,690
Life is SoLight with Solar.
